    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Orgs with no SBQQ__QuoteTemplate__c marked Default = true.
Why it matters: Reps generating a quote PDF get an &quot;no default template&quot; error and have to pick manually each time. Inconsistent customer-facing documents and slower quote velocity.
Suppress a finding: only if your org generates documents through a custom integration.
Disable the detector: only when CPQ templates are intentionally not used. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
